WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.750
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and recently
there has been a lot of stuff going down behind

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:05.750
the scenes with the Marvel Universe.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:11.920
Robert Downey Jr. said no plans for Iron Man
4, which was kind of expected and on the other

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:16.779
side of the coin, Dave Bautista is going through
some contract changes that would allow him

00:00:16.779 --> 00:00:18.390
to play a bigger part in the movies.

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:22.700
Also as you may have noticed, I’ve got a
bunch of comments that people like the old

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:23.700
set better.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.760
I just moved to a new apartment and I’m
still setting up my new studio.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:30.150
So this is what things will look like temporarily.

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:34.039
But the big tease is that his new deal will
allow Bautista ato guest star in the next

00:00:34.039 --> 00:00:35.039
Avengers movie.

00:00:35.039 --> 00:00:36.039
I’ll explain what it all really means.

00:00:36.039 --> 00:00:40.280
If you’re just finding me for the first
time, I do Marvel videos every week and Agents

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:44.019
of SHIELD when it comes back so be sure to
subscribe to get everything.

00:00:44.019 --> 00:00:52.059
Just to explain the Robert Downey Jr stuff
real quick, it’s not that they absolutely

00:00:52.059 --> 00:00:53.789
won’t make Iron Man 4.

00:00:53.789 --> 00:01:00.239
It’s just that Marvel is allowing Robert
Downey Jr. to either come up with a script

00:01:00.239 --> 00:01:02.480
or pass on the armor.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:05.100
He also gets to pick his own successor.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:09.960
So the next Tony Stark will be cast by Robert
Downey Jr himself.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:15.640
It won’t happen till well after Avengers
3, so we can talk about that later.

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:23.920
Drax the Destroyer is the new young gun.

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:27.280
If you remember, during Guardians when Peter
Quill kept going on and on about how awesome

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:28.280
earth was, Drax said.

00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:29.579
I shall have to go there one day…

00:01:29.579 --> 00:01:31.390
That wasn’t specifically intended to be
a teaser.

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:33.580
Just one of those Marvel Universe lines where
the writer.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:36.700
In this case, James Gunn, was leaving room
for the future.

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:42.729
But James Gunn didn’t know what the whole
Marvel Phase 3 plan was before making Guardians

00:01:42.729 --> 00:01:45.490
or anything.

00:01:45.490 --> 00:01:49.880
Usually when first movies like that get made,
because there’s always a risk they could

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:50.880
flop.

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:52.710
They’re written to be a little more self-contained.

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:54.939
Unlike say Captain America The Winter Soldier.

00:01:54.939 --> 00:02:01.249
Which basically crumbled the SHIELD glue that
was holding all the Earth-Based movies together.

00:02:01.249 --> 00:02:08.289
I always viewed SHIELD, Samuel Jackson and
Agent Coulson as the one common thread across

00:02:08.289 --> 00:02:09.819
all the phase 1 movies.

00:02:09.819 --> 00:02:16.370
Now it’s starting to turn into the infinity
gems and Thanos’ quest.

00:02:16.370 --> 00:02:21.660
Based on the pacing so far it seems like they’ll
stretch that out all across phase 3.

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:26.970
So if you haven’t read any comics about
the infinity gauntlet, don’t worry.

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:29.550
You still have a long time to catch up.

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:33.930
Eventually everyone will have to come together
and stop Thanos, The Guardians will have to

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:35.590
overlap with The Avengers.

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:43.080
That’s also something that isn’t happening
before Guardians 2, that movie is currently

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:45.420
scheduled for 2017.

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:48.511
James Gunn has already confirmed that there
will be no more humans joining the team.

00:02:48.511 --> 00:02:52.530
There will be another female though.

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:56.350
But Drax has become the center of the crossover
talk.

00:02:56.350 --> 00:03:03.030
There has to be a reason for the guardians
and the avengers to meetup.

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:12.310
They won’t just meet for shawarma.

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:16.400
The easy way in to a full blown crossover
is by letting one character guest star in

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:19.680
the other’s movie.

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:23.650
Previously it was rumored that Hulk would
be guest starring in a future Guardians movie.

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:25.280
Whether or not that’s still the case.

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:29.660
Now it’s all about Marvel re-working Dave
Bautista’s contract to allow him to be in

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:35.440
an Avengers movie.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:42.690
Hold the phone though, I know some of your
are wondering, if only Drax is going to guest

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:51.330
star in Avengers 3, does that mean they won’t
do the infinity gauntlet?

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:58.010
It kind of sounds like it.

00:03:58.010 --> 00:04:12.340
It’s totally possible that Marvel could
wait till phase 4 to bring all of the gems

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:13.340
together.

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:17.789
As it stands, there are only two more gems
we haven’t seen yet.

00:04:17.789 --> 00:04:19.700
The Time Gem and the Soul Gem.

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:24.131
So one possible solution that would allow
them to prolong the Thanos Infinity Quest

00:04:24.131 --> 00:04:31.870
storyline would be to have the gems trade
hands a couple of times.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.260
Like at the end of Thor the Dark World.

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:36.920
The Reality Gem aka the Aether, is given to
the Collector.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:40.720
Imagine someone steals it from him, things
like that will probably happen over the course

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:44.600
of phase 3.

00:04:44.600 --> 00:04:49.630
Loki’s staff is pretty much the mind gem.

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:55.390
And it went from Thanos, to Loki, to the Avengers,
to Baron Von Strucker and presumably at the

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:58.260
end of the movie, back to the avengers.

00:04:58.260 --> 00:05:05.000
So the big question is what story would Avengers
3 be, that it requires Drax the Destroyer

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.810
but not the Guardians?

00:05:06.810 --> 00:05:13.600
I know a lot of you have asked me if they’ll
do Civil War as a possible storyline.

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:19.360
I don’t think they will, just because Winter
Soldier had a lot of the DNA of Civil War.

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:24.760
Basically eliminating every superhero on the
planet and the idea of a big government conspiracy.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:29.190
Usually the sequels do a good job of following
up the preceding movie with a logical next

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:30.190
step.

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:34.060
So Avengers 2 is picking up where Winter Soldier
leaves off.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:46.030
Cleaning up all the remnants of HYDRA all
over the world.

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:49.690
So if Ultron is going to create an army of
replicants to take over the world, the avengers

00:05:49.690 --> 00:05:53.650
will first have to neutralize him somehow
and then deal with the cleanup again.

00:05:53.650 --> 00:06:03.320
It’s a little too soon to speculate on Avengers
3 beyond that just because Joss Whedon is

00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:06.080
always really good at surprising with left
turns.

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:17.350
I’m really hoping to see Carol Danvers and
a tease for the rest of Phase 3.

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:22.520
As of right now, the only confirmed projects
are Ant-Man which is in the middle of shooting,

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:29.060
Doctor Strange, which is still locking down
an actor, Guardians 2, which is in pre-production,

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:32.100
Avengers 3, which is also in pre-production
and Black Panther.

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:33.990
Which is searching for a director and a script
re-write.

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:37.180
The Inhumans movie and the Miss Marvel or
Captain Marvel movie, how ever you want to

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:44.970
think about it are also in development, but
no word on which order we’ll see them.

00:06:44.970 --> 00:06:58.000
The big takeaway from all the Drax talk is
that the avengers guardians crossover will

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:04.199
be more of a guest appearance before it becomes
a full blown team up.

00:07:04.199 --> 00:07:09.860
If you didn’t see it, some promo art for
the vision leaked recently.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:15.180
He looks pretty much like he does in the comics.

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:29.800
But you can 
also see the finished Avengers Tower in the

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:31.030
background.

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:34.520
There are a few people missing from this picture,
but you get the idea.

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:35.990
It’s all about The Vision.

